==Battleground==
*1 [[Incubator]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s (400%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**3 [[Incubator]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Incubator]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**9 [[Incubator]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even on {{4c}}, the mini waves aren't super threatening, and can't reach [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], so by spamming meatshields and a single Bahamut, you can clear this stage.

